 (N'Privacy & Security', N'Content Policy Chain', N'Visit a page that loads a script from `doubleclick.net` - **Expected:** DevTools Network tab shows that script request as blocked (`ERR_BLOCKED_BY_CLIENT`, initiator "ContentPolicy"), while unrelated resource types from the same host still load.', 216),
