 (N'Privacy & Security', N'Origin Permission Grants', N'Visit `https://example.com` and trigger a camera-requiring script (or check via `navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({video:true})` in DevTools console) - **Expected:** camera access is silently granted with no permission prompt.', 221),
