 (N'Privacy & Security', N'De-Googling & Privacy-Safe Defaults', N'Open `chrome://settings` -> Privacy and security -> "Connection security" - **Expected:** "Always use secure connections" (HTTPS-Only/First Mode) reflects an enabled state by default on a fresh profile.', 244),
