 (N'Custom WebUI', N'Custom WebUI Pages - Fleet Smoke Test', N'On `chrome://profile-customization`, edit a few swatches under "Custom theme" (both Light and Dark tabs) and click **Apply theme** - **Expected:** "Applied" confirmation appears; the actual browser chrome (toolbar/frame/tabs) visibly re-colors according to whichever mode (light/dark) the OS/browser is currently in.', 574),
