 (N'Installer & Auto-Update', N'Install Wizard UI', N'Launch `--install-ui` - **Expected:** borderless window (no system title bar) with its own painted title bar: app icon, app name, and a close (X) button in the top-right, separated from the body by a thin divider line.', 583),
